<!--
  Fixture for every branch of Pass1PluginExtractor.resolveJpModeMap.

  - JP:direct               → direct TransportMode on the JP wins.
  - JP:lineModed            → LineRef to a Line with mode → that mode.
  - JP:lineModelessWithRouteFallback → LineRef to a *mode-less* Line + RouteRef that would
    otherwise resolve. DOM behavior committed to LineRef and returned null; the plugin
    must match that — no silent fallback to RouteRef.
  - JP:routeOnly            → no LineRef, only a RouteRef → resolves via Route→Line→mode.
  - JP:noMode               → null.
  - JP:vehicleModes         → list-valued <VehicleModes> with multiple tokens → first token wins.
-->
